# Medicare data

- Primary counties: Miami-Dade, Broward, Palm Beach.
- Secondary: Orange, Osceola, Seminole, Polk, Hillsborough, Pasco, Pinellas.
- Never treat plans from different counties as interchangeable.
- Required identifiers: plan year, county, carrier, plan name, contract, PBP/segment, verification status, source, last verified date.
- Do not invent 2027 benefits. Carry-forward 2026 values must stay labeled as draft / pending CMS.
- Do not store SSN, Medicare Beneficiary Identifier, full DOB, bank data, or other sensitive member identifiers.
- Structured data lives under `data/`. The Google Sheet is a generated interface.
